@rekram1-node

Rough workaround now is to restrict general, explore and others to spawn their subagents via task, questions have the same issue https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/7654
```json
"agent": {
    "general": {
      "steps": 50,
      "permission": {
        // [BUG] Questions from nested sub-agents don't appear in TUI https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/7654
        "task": "deny",
        "question": "allow",
        "todowrite": "allow"
      }
    },
    "explore": {
      "steps": 50,
      "permission": {
        // [BUG] Questions from nested sub-agents don't appear in TUI https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/7654
        "task": "deny",
        "question": "allow",
        "todowrite": "allow"
      }
    }
  },
```
